name flexipage
category Package
revision 66614
shortdesc Flexible page geometry with marginalia
relocated 1
longdesc This package allows easy page layout if marginalia is required.
longdesc Mid document changes are possible such as: new marginal width,
longdesc full width text, and landscape text without marginal. Partners
longdesc well with the package sidenotesplus. The package also aids the
longdesc layout for book printing, allowing for binding corrections and
longdesc adding page bleed, if required.
runfiles size=4
 RELOC/tex/latex/flexipage/flexipage.sty
